                                                "sense_id": "87cc7dc2-329e-38f3-a446-cdff17acb32f",
                                                "text": "The auctioneer, with his fruity, theatrical voice and his gavel, hits a block of wood in precisely the same spot, no matter the day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25a44282-a518-44cc-bdf2-e0e7c8d1c6b6",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc7dc2-329e-38f3-a446-cdff17acb32f",
                                                "text": "But there are many items that auctioneers sell every day in various garb: industrial equipment, autos and real estate, to name a few."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94112d8e-4cdc-4b09-a4be-9a8513395a7d",
                                                "sense_id": "87cc7dc2-329e-38f3-a446-cdff17acb32f",
                                                "text": "The auctioneer donated the monument to FOLHC and they got to work restoring his plot."
                                            }
